  -h, --help              Show this message and exit.

Commands:
  backfill       Run ``name`` once over an explicit [start_time,...
  create         Create a new job from a ``type`` + ``--app-path``.
  delete         Delete a job definition (does not affect past execution...
  deploy         Deploy a job end to end: upload, set environment,...
  history        List past executions of a job (newest first).
  info           Show the configuration of a single job.
  list           List every job defined in the active project.
  logs           Read stdout/stderr logs for a job execution.
  run            Start a new one-off execution of ``name``.
  schedule       Attach (or update) a Quartz cron schedule to ``name``.
  schedule-info  Print the currently attached schedule, if any.
  stop           Stop the most recent execution of ``name``.
  unschedule     Remove the schedule from a job.
